                Shove(range: 6.0, angle: 179.0, damage: 5.0, knockback: 14.0, up: 1.8),
            ], juice: Some((title: Some("PUSH UP THE SKY"), boom: true, ripple: 6.0))),
            // The hook as a grapple: yank yourself to where it bites. -> ends there, moving.
